OL,3,GNEWSADetectives hunt hit-and-run driver
OL,4,Aafter 12-year-old cyclist injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are trying to trace a driver
OL,7,Fwho failed to stop after hitting a
OL,8,F12-year-old boy on a pedal bike in
OL,9,FDundee.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland said the child was
OL,12,Fstruck by a black Citroen
OL,13,FBerlingo-style vehicle, which was
OL,14,Ftravelling south in lane two of the A90
OL,15,FKingsway East.
OL,17,FThe incident happened at the pedestrian
OL,18,Fcrossing, near Kingsway Scottish Fire
OL,19,Fand Rescue Service Station, at about
OL,20,F18:05 on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
